    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get the need for due diligence, but we're on a really tight timeline for the Q3 rollout and the budget is already locked in for this specific \"Rapid Action/Comfort\" approach. The stakeholders are looking for a green light on this direction so we can move to production. If we wait for a full cross-reference of every cohort, we're going to miss the launch window. Can we just look at the high-level trends for now? I need to know if we can safely proceed with this messaging without getting flagged.",
